From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Claude Opus 5.5" <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 08:00:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 12/35] Branding: Ibasho's own icons and logos

Replaces the Eye-in-Hand and the Second Life logo wherever this build
could show them: the application icons (icons/test, which non-Linden
channels use, and res/), the installer icons, the login screen logos (now
the Ibasho mark and name), the system-message badge (now a neutral "i"),
the icon beside place links, the system folder icons, the picture for a
place without one and an unused tab icon. The new images are original,
drawn with a script (make_art.py in the Ibasho release repo), and licensed
CC BY-SA 3.0 like the artwork they replace; the change is recorded in
doc/LICENSE-logos.txt.
---
